/-!
# VIII09 — genuine compact representatives of the real ε³ odd sources

Anchor `(R_h, R_i, Q) = (3, 1, 3/2)`, `I = (3, ∞)`, `N = (R-3)(R-1)`, `P = N/R`,
compact variable `x = 1/R`, `n(x) = 1 - 4x + 3x²`, profile window `UG = (-1/12, 5/12)`,
`KG = [0, 1/3]`.

The whole compact layer is built from the one genuine parameter integral

  `J k m x = ∫₀¹ t ^ k * (1 - t x)⁻¹ ^ (m + 1) dt`,

whose denominator `1 - t x` is bounded below by `7/12` on `t ∈ [0,1]`, `x ∈ UG`.
Every regularity and identity statement below is about these integrals — in particular
`Hc 0 = 1` and `Gc 0 = 1/2` are values of the integral, not junk values of `log (1-x) / x`
continued to zero.

* `Hc = J 0 0`, `Gc = J 1 0` are C² on `UG` with `deriv Hc = HcD`, `deriv HcD = HcDD`;
* `Hc x - x Gc x = 1` and `x Hc x = -log (1 - x)` on `UG`;
* `Ubar`, `Zbar` are the averaged-logarithm profiles with `Ubar 0 = -7/72`, `Zbar 0 = -7/144`;
* `q3_j = j³ Q3`, `r3_j = j³ R3` are C¹ on `UG` with the task-book source bounds.
-/

